    <section id="sect-00003">
      <title>Additional Resources</title>
      <section id="sect-00004">
        <title>Solving Equations and Creating Equivalent Equations</title>
        <para id="para-00014">One way to create equivalent equations is to solve the equation. In each step of solving, an equivalent equation is created.</para>
        <para id="para-00015">Here is a general strategy for solving linear equations:</para>
        <para id="para-00016"><emphasis>Step 1 -</emphasis> Simplify each side of the equation as much as possible.</para>
        <para id="para-00017">Use the Distributive Property to remove any parentheses. Combine like terms.</para>
        <para id="para-00018"><emphasis>Step 2 -</emphasis> Collect all the variable terms on one side of the equation.</para>
        <para id="para-00019">Use the Addition or Subtraction Property of Equality.</para>
        <para id="para-00020"><emphasis>Step 3 -</emphasis> Collect all the constant terms on the other side of the equation.</para>
        <para id="para-00021">Use the Addition or Subtraction Property of Equality.</para>
        <para id="para-00022"><emphasis>Step 4 -</emphasis> Make the coefficient of the variable term equal to 1.</para>
        <para id="para-00023">Use the Multiplication or Division Property of Equality.</para>
        <para id="para-00052">State the solution to the equation.</para>
        <para id="para-00024"><emphasis>Step 5 -</emphasis> Check the solution.</para>
        <para id="para-00025">Substitute the solution into the original equation to make sure the result is a true statement.</para>
        <section id="sect-00005">
          <para id="para-00096"><emphasis>Example 1</emphasis></para>
          <para id="para-00026">Here is an example of solving equations. Notice that each step is an acceptable move that creates an equivalent equation.</para>
          <para id="para-00027"><emphasis>Step 1 -</emphasis> Simplify each side of the equation as much as possible.</para>
          <para id="para-00028">Use the Distributive Property to remove any parentheses.</para>
          <para id="para-00029"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00030"><emphasis>Step 2 -</emphasis> Collect all the variable terms on one side of the equation.</para>
          <para id="para-00031">Nothing to do. All the variables of <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> are on the left side.</para>
          <para id="para-00032"><emphasis>Step 3 -</emphasis> Collect all the constant terms on the other side of the equation.</para>
          <para id="para-00033">Use the Addition or Subtraction Property of Equality.</para>
          <para id="para-00034"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo style="color:red">+</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn style="color:red">1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn style="color:red">8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo style="color:red">+</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn style="color:red">1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn style="color:red">8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>42</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00035"><emphasis>Step 4 -</emphasis> Make the coefficient of the variable term equal to 1.</para>
          <para id="para-00036">Use the Multiplication or Division Property of Equality.</para>
          <para id="para-00037"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>42</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00038"><emphasis>Step 5 -</emphasis> Check the solution.</para>
          <para id="para-00039">Substitute the solution into the original equation to make sure the result is a true statement.</para>
          <para id="para-00040"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo style="color:red">−</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn style="color:red">7</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mi>✓</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para></section>
        <section id="sect-00006">
          <para id="para-00097"><emphasis>Example 2</emphasis></para>
          <para id="para-00041">Find the solution for <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
          <para id="para-00042"><emphasis>Step 1</emphasis> - Simplify each side of the equation as much as possible.</para>
          <para id="para-00043"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00044"><emphasis>Step 2 -</emphasis> Collect all the variable terms on one side of the equation.</para>
          <para id="para-00045"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00046"><emphasis>Step 3 -</emphasis> Collect all the constant terms on the other side of the equation.</para>
          <para id="para-00047"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00048"><emphasis>Step 4 -</emphasis> Make the coefficient of the variable term equal to 1.</para>
          <para id="para-00049"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mfrac><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00050"><emphasis>Step 5 -</emphasis> Check the solution.</para>
          <para id="para-00051"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>19</m:mn><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>21</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>19</m:mn><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>19</m:mn><m:mi>✓</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para></section>
        <section id="sect-00007">
          <para id="para-00098"><emphasis>Example 3</emphasis></para>
          <para id="para-00053">Solve <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
          <para id="para-00054"><emphasis>Step 1 -</emphasis> Simplify each side of the equation as much as possible.</para>
          <para id="para-00055"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>21</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>21</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00056"><emphasis>Step 2 -</emphasis> Collect all the variable terms on one side of the equation.</para>
          <para id="para-00057"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>21</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>21</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00058"><emphasis>Step 3 -</emphasis> Collect all the constant terms on the other side of the equation.</para>
          <para id="para-00059"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>21</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>21</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>21</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>45</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00060"><emphasis>Step 4 -</emphasis> Make the coefficient of the variable term equal to 1.</para>
          <para id="para-00061"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>45</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00062"><emphasis>Step 5 -</emphasis> Check the solution.</para>
          <para id="para-00063"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>108</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>90</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>108</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>86</m:mn><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>114</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>114</m:mn><m:mi>✓</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para></section>
      </section>
      <section id="sect-00008">
        <title>Video: Acceptable Moves</title>
        <para id="para-00064">Watch the following video to learn more about acceptable moves.</para>
        <media alt="Placeholder for Alt Text">
          <iframe width="660" height="371.4" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/84fd718f1e7fa4c23f38cb1f2a45b7a21744d55f"/>
        </media>
        <note class="try" id="note-00002">
          <title>Try It: Solving Equations and Creating Equivalent Equations</title>
          <exercise id="exer-00003">
            <problem id="prob-00003">
              <para id="para-00065">Write two equivalent equations to <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
              <para id="para-00066">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
            </problem>
            <solution id="sol-00003">
              <para id="para-00067">Compare your answer:</para>
              <para id="para-00068">Your answer may vary, but here are some samples.</para>
              <list id="list-00005">
                <item><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></item>
                <item><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></item>
                <item><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></item>
              </list>
            </solution>
          </exercise>
          <exercise id="exer-00004">
            <problem id="prob-00004">
              <para id="para-00069">Solve <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
              <para id="para-00070">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
            </problem>
            <solution id="sol-00004">
              <para id="para-00071">Compare your answer:</para>
              <para id="para-00072">
                <emphasis>Step 1 -</emphasis> Simplify each side of the equation as much as possible. Use the Distributive Property to remove any parentheses.</para>
              <para id="para-00073"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00074">
                <emphasis>Step 2 -</emphasis> Collect all the variable terms on one side of the equation. Nothing to do. All the variables of x are on the left side.</para>
              <para id="para-00075">
                <emphasis>Step 3 -</emphasis> Collect all the constant terms on the other side of the equation.</para>
              <para id="para-00076">Use the Addition or Subtraction Property of Equality.</para>
              <para id="para-00077"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo style="color:red">−</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn style="color:red">8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo style="color:red">−</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn style="color:red">8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00078">
                <emphasis>Step 4 -</emphasis> Make the coefficient of the variable term equal to 1. Use the Multiplication or Division Property of Equality.</para>
              <para id="para-00079"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mfrac><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00080">
                <emphasis>Step 5 -</emphasis> Check the solution.</para>
              <para id="para-00081">Substitute the solution into the original equation to make sure the result is a true statement.</para>
              <para id="para-00082"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn style="color:red">2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>✓</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para></solution>
          </exercise>
          <exercise id="exer-00005">
            <problem id="prob-00005">
              <para id="para-00083">Solve <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
              <para id="para-00084">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
            </problem>
            <solution id="sol-00005">
              <para id="para-00085">Compare your answer:</para>
              <para id="para-00086"><emphasis>Step 1 -</emphasis> Simplify each side of the equation as much as possible.</para>
              <para id="para-00087"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>40</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>52</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00088"><emphasis>Step 2 -</emphasis> Collect all the variable terms on one side of the equation.</para>
              <para id="para-00089"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>52</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>52</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00090"><emphasis>Step 3 -</emphasis> Collect all the constant terms on the other side of the equation.</para>
              <para id="para-00091"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>52</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>52</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>52</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>42</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00092"><emphasis>Step 4 -</emphasis> Make the coefficient of the variable term equal to 1.</para>
              <para id="para-00093"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>42</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00094"><emphasis>Step 5 -</emphasis> Check the solution.</para>
              <para id="para-00095"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>30</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>88</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>32</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>100</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>96</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>100</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>100</m:mn><m:mi>✓</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para></solution>
          </exercise>
        </note>
      </section>
    </section>
  </content>
</document>